The bro ship got longer.

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:59.440
Yeah, if that got possible, yeah.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.060
Cool guys, so today we're talking about Mario Brothers, released in the arcade in 1983,

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.660
